          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Beweis is the noun of beweisen \"to prove\", built with be- on weisen \"to show, to direct\": a proof shows the thing. EtymDB has no history for the noun, so this is the plain make-up."
            }
          ]
        },
